.\",\"hi\":\"किन्हीं दो घटनाओं के लिए P(A∪B)=P(A)+P(B)-P(A∩B) होता है।\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Probability is a numerical measure of uncertainty assigned to an event.\",\"hi\":\"प्रायिकता किसी घटना की अनिश्चितता को दिया गया संख्यात्मक माप है।\"}},\"difficulty\":\"basic\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified: SSC CGL Statistics — Compound Probability\",\"source_metadata\":null,\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0}],\"nextCursor\":\"833a1021-7e07-4c54-ade7-5aba200dd18a\",\"hasMore\":true}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":300,"tags":["question-batch","question-batch:topic:v9:cb50a003-e3c3-4629-aac4-b1d97965afff"]}